0..71 Comment "//! The terms of a sort of a theory, where the slice of the sorts ends."
72..75 Comment "//!"
76..152 Comment "//! `Terms S s` is the type of the closed terms of one sort of a theory. The"
153..231 Comment "//! tree derives that type for some sorts alone, and an author must know them."
232..235 Comment "//!"
236..308 Comment "//! The slice reads sorts in two layers. The first is a plain sort whose"
309..386 Comment "//! operations take terms of that sort alone. The second is a sort over plain"
387..466 Comment "//! sorts whose ports state closed indices. A sort outside the slice is refused"
467..507 Comment "//! at the type that asks for its terms."
508..511 Comment "//!"
512..528 Comment "//! - see: #8358"
529..605 Comment "//! - see: `model/desc/terms-of-a-sort.gandr` — the fragment at two widths"
606..684 Comment "//! - owes: #4150 — an operation across two plain sorts, and an index with a"
685..699 Comment "//!   variable"
